				8
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Normalize entry points to `Fn` and fix document sync IPC\n\nContinue the standardization of binary and service entry points by renaming descriptive function names (e.g., `ExtensionPopulate`, `CocoonStart`) to the universal `Fn` identifier across `AppLifecycle.rs` and `Entry.rs`. This aligns the main entry flow with the recent changes to `WindServiceHandlers`.\n\nCorrect the `Mountain` ↔ `Cocoon` IPC for `sky:model:contentChanged`. Ensure `Uri` existence is validated before accessing `Payload` fields to prevent null dereferences. Move the `cocoon-main` notification emission inside the valid block to guarantee extensions only receive updates for existing documents. Explicitly cast `Line` and `Character` to `u32` when constructing `PositionDTO` to satisfy strict Rust type requirements.\n\nUpdate `.gitignore` to correctly distinguish between the `Mountain` binary and the `Target/debug/Mountain/` artifact directory, preventing accidental commits of generated build files. Remove previously tracked `index.html` artifacts from the `Target` directory.",
			"SHA": "2981699766b232f95ff57b662c457ef16797e679"
		},
